#: index (atribut / attribute) languages (atribut / attribute) privacy (atribut / attribute) licenses (atribut / attribute)
msgid ""
"Swajp – swipe keyboard for Android, no internet access, offline dictation."
msgstr ""
"Swajp – Wischtastatur für Android, ohne Internetzugriff, Offline-Diktat."

